<title>GERMANY: Mannesmann 9-mth sales up, orders flat.</title>
<headline>Mannesmann 9-mth sales up, orders flat.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders	     26,985	 vs  26,996</p>
<p>    Group sales			   23,861	 vs  22,598</p>
<p>    Domestic sales			10,490	 vs   9,796</p>
<p>    International sales		 13,371	 vs  12,802</p>
<p>    Number of employees		120,427	 vs 123,869</p>
<p>    Investment			     1,746	 vs   1,498</p>
<p>    Mobile phone sales		   2,961	 vs   1,899</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Mannesmann AG.</p>
<p>-- Douglas Busvine, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
